<title>SPAIN: TABLE-Spain's Amper H1 net profit up 26 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Spain's Amper H1 net profit up 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six months to end-June for Amper (in billions of pesetas, unless stated):</p>
<p> Consolidated net profit	    2.75	vs    2.18</p>
<p> Sales				   18.32	vs   21.23</p>
<p> Cash flow				3.71	up   14.9 pct</p>
</text>
